; rowfind_ungridded: ROWFIND without a grid must raise.
;
; No RESIZE ran, so rows = cols = 0. Both VMs used to answer -1 here (an
; empty scan), which is indistinguishable from "searched a real row and
; found nothing" -- so this raises InvalidGridDimensions instead, like
; every other grid-addressed opcode.

PUSH 4
BSMX r0

PUSH 0           ; row
PUSH 1           ; value
ROWFIND r0
HALT
